<figure class="shipping-event-diagram" aria-labelledby="shipping-event-caption">
  <svg
    class="shipping-event-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 600"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="shipping-event-title shipping-event-desc"
  >
    <title id="shipping-event-title">兩種通知順序，保留同一份正向進度</title>
    <desc id="shipping-event-desc">
      已確認的對外送達回報先到或後到，最後都保留物流回報送達。晚到運送中只補事件紀錄。
      退件與更正另外打開待核對標記，普通正向通知不能清除它。
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker
        id="shipping-event-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path
          class="shipping-event-diagram__arrow-head"
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__panel"
      x="24"
      y="24"
      width="912"
      height="552"
      rx="18"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__heading" x="48" y="63"
      >通知順序改變，正向進度不倒退</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__lead" x="48" y="95"
      >前提：同一份派工，且送達已確認是往原收件端。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="48"
      y="120"
      width="864"
      height="126"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__label" x="72" y="153"
      >送達回報先到</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="190">送達回報</text>
    <path
      class="shipping-event-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 158 185 H 220"
      marker-end="url(#shipping-event-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="242" y="190"
      >晚到運送中</text
    >
    <path
      class="shipping-event-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 348 185 H 410"
      marker-end="url(#shipping-event-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__result" x="432" y="190"
      >保留「物流回報送達」</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="222"
      >運送中只補事件紀錄，不覆寫較後進度。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="48"
      y="264"
      width="864"
      height="126"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__label" x="72" y="297">運送中先到</text>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="334">運送中</text>
    <path
      class="shipping-event-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 158 329 H 220"
      marker-end="url(#shipping-event-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="242" y="334">送達回報</text>
    <path
      class="shipping-event-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 348 329 H 410"
      marker-end="url(#shipping-event-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__result" x="432" y="334"
      >更新為「物流回報送達」</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="366"
      >中間通知可以缺漏，無須等每一站補齊。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="48"
      y="408"
      width="864"
      height="116"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__review" x="72" y="442"
      >獨立的待核對標記</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="473"
      >退件、矛盾或方向不明 → 待核對；後到正向通知不清除。</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="72" y="500"
      >更正核對預期版本，並停止普通通知自動推進。</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__note" x="48" y="551"
      >配送資訊更新不直接替訂單、退款或財務結案。</text
    >
  </svg>

  <svg
    class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 320 700"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="shipping-event-mobile-title shipping-event-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="shipping-event-mobile-title">通知順序與待核對標記</title>
    <desc id="shipping-event-mobile-desc">
      桌面圖的直向排列。送達先到或後到，都保留物流回報送達。
      退件與更正另外打開待核對標記，普通正向通知不能清除。
    </desc>
    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__panel"
      x="4"
      y="4"
      width="312"
      height="692"
      rx="16"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__heading" x="20" y="36"
      >同一份派工，兩種順序</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__detail" x="20" y="64"
      >送達須已確認往原收件端。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="16"
      y="88"
      width="288"
      height="160"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__label" x="32" y="120"
      >送達回報先到</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="153"
      >送達回報 → 晚到運送中</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-result" x="32" y="185"
      >保留「物流回報送達」</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="217"
      >運送中只補紀錄。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="16"
      y="268"
      width="288"
      height="160"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__label" x="32" y="300">運送中先到</text>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="333"
      >運送中 → 送達回報</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-result" x="32" y="365"
      >更新為「物流回報送達」</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="397"
      >中間通知可以缺漏。</text
    >

    <rect
      class="shipping-event-diagram__card"
      x="16"
      y="448"
      width="288"
      height="164"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__review" x="32" y="480"
      >獨立的待核對標記</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="512"
      >退件、矛盾、方向不明</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="538"
      >都開啟待核對。</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="564"
      >正向通知不清除標記，</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="32" y="590"
      >更正後改由人工接管。</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="20" y="647"
      >配送更新不直接替訂單、</text
    >
    <text class="shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail" x="20" y="674"
      >退款或財務結案。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="shipping-event-caption">
    事件保留收到的紀錄，進度依轉移規則更新；待核對標記獨立保存，避免後到正向通知掩蓋待核對案件。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .shipping-event-diagram {
    margin-block: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__panel {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__heading {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__lead {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__label {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__detail,
  .shipping-event-diagram__note {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__result,
  .shipping-event-diagram__mobile-result {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f766e;
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__review {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: #9a3412;
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__mobile {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram__mobile-detail {
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .shipping-event-diagram__result,
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .shipping-event-diagram__mobile-result {
    fill: #5eead4;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .shipping-event-diagram__review {
    fill: #fdba74;
  }
  .shipping-event-diagram figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .shipping-event-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .shipping-event-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
